                "body": "=== INTAKE FORM DATA ===\nSubmitted: {{formatDate(now; \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\")}}\n\nBASIC INFO:\n- Name: {{2.fullName}}\n- Email: {{2.email}}\n- Phone: {{2.phone}}\n- Address: {{2.address}}\n- Household: {{2.householdMembers}}\n\nDIETARY REQUIREMENTS:\n- Family dietary protocol: {{1.`Does your family adhere to a specific diet or protocol?`}}\n- Protocol details: {{1.`If you answered YES, please detail.`}}\n- Allergies/Sensitivities: {{1.`Please share any allergies, sensitivities and/or aversions for EACH member of the household:`}}\n- Desired outcomes: {{join(1.`Desired outcome of our Service (check all that apply)`; \", \")}}\n\nMEAL PREFERENCES:\n- Meal types needed: {{join(1.`Types of Meals, each week (check all that apply)`; \", \")}}\n- Healthy eating means: {{1.`What does \"healthy eating\" mean to you?`}}\n- Meals per week: {{1.`Quantity of Meals/Week? (ie. Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner, 4 days/week)`}}\n- Daily food routine: {{1.`Daily Food Routine (please note anything you want to stay the same or would like to change regarding your/your family's current schedule).`}}\n\nPROTEINS:\n- Meat: {{join(1.`Proteins - MEAT`; \", \")}}\n- Poultry: {{join(1.`Proteins - Poultry`; \", \")}}\n- Seafood: {{join(1.`Proteins - Seafood`; \", \")}}\n- Vegetarian: {{join(1.`Vegetarian Proteins`; \", \")}}\n\nVEGETABLES:\n- Green: {{join(1.`Veggies - Green`; \", \")}}\n- Yellow/Orange: {{join(1.`Veggies - Yellow/Orange`; \", \")}}\n- Red/Purple: {{join(1.`Veggies - Red/Purple`; \", \")}}\n- White: {{join(1.`Veggies - White`; \", \")}}\n\nOTHER FOODS:\n- Salads: {{join(1.Salads; \", \")}}\n- Soups: {{join(1.Soups; \", \")}}\n- Fruits: {{join(1.Fruit; \", \")}}\n- Grains: {{join(1.`Grains & Starches`; \", \")}}\n- Beans: {{join(1.`Beans & Legumes`; \", \")}}\n- Nuts/Seeds: {{join(1.`Nuts & Seeds`; \", \")}}\n- Dairy: {{join(1.`Milk & Dairy`; \", \")}}\n\nFLAVORS:\n- Herbs: {{join(1.`Herbs & Seasonings`; \", \")}}\n- Sauces: {{join(1.`Sauces & Condiments`; \", \")}}\n- Spice Level: {{join(1.`Spice Level`; \", \")}}\n\nCUISINE INTERESTS:\n- International: {{1.`Are you interested in trying new international cuisines? (ie. Greek, Italian, Thai, Indian, Mexican, Asian, etc)`}}\n- Favorite meals: {{1.`Please list your current favorite meals:`}}\n- Favorite restaurants: {{1.`Please list your current favorite restaurants:`}}\n\nREFERRAL: {{1.`Referrals FEED us - please let us know who referred you, so we can thank them!`}}\n\n=== END INTAKE DATA ===\n\nSTATUS: Agreement sent - waiting for signature",
